      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这次的粉丝投票，\n鲁道夫象征输给了前辈，只拿到第二名。\n她似乎很在意这件事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da01ce78001fd60276cdd2c54818a83e200ae9098c594614a4bb104b059fb54b",
